        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: “No Matter What”, Notting Hill soundtrack, Notting Hill\n- People: Richard Curtis, Duncan Kenworthy, Roger Michell\n- Topics: American radio release, film production, screenplay\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Curtis wrote the screenplay for the 1999 film Notting Hill after previously writing Four Weddings and a Funeral in 1994.\n- Duncan Kenworthy produced the 1999 film Notting Hill.\n- Roger Michell directed the 1999 film Notting Hill.\n- The song “No Matter What” was featured on the US edition of the soundtrack to the 1999 film Notting Hill.\n- The song “No Matter What” was released to American radio on 10 May 1999.",
